                <div class="font-bold text-amber-900 mb-2 flex items-center gap-2">
                  <span class="text-xl">🏛️</span> 2026 UNESCO Relic Dossier Summary
                </div>
                <p class="text-slate-700 text-sm">
                  Vietnam officially submitted the Cu Chi Tunnels to the <strong>UNESCO World Heritage Tentative List</strong> on July 15, 2026, under cultural criteria (iv) and (vi). The dossier defines a 15.11-hectare nominated property protecting roughly 4 km of intact multi-tier tunnel chambers across Ben Duoc and Ben Dinh.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
